  "id": "linux-nvidia-dgx-spark-qwen38-27b-atlas",
  "name": "DGX Spark Qwen3.8 27B Atlas (SparkQwen 27B)",
  "version": 6,
  "summary": "Qwen3.8-27B on one DGX Spark with SparkQwen's single-Spark Atlas build: exact speculative decoding with the DFlash2 drafter (DSpine beside it in the max mode), output byte-identical to serial decode at every concurrency, 262144-token context. Three modes: default (64 requests), saver (8 requests in about 78 GB) and max (both drafters, 32 requests). Additive only: no default model, no aliases.",
  "description": "This recipe installs SparkQwen's 27B variant at the immutable product revision recorded in backends/atlas-sparkqwen/pins-27b-5b9fecbcf5d9.json. The Atlas engine image is built from Enntity/sparkqwen by install/build.sh with SPARKQWEN_MODEL=27b and published to GHCR; LLooM commits no engine source. Setup acquires NVIDIA's checkpoint, the DFlash2 and DSpine drafters and TandemLLM's NVFP4 Gated DeltaNet and attention weights at pinned revisions (overlay and DSpine files sha256-checked), pulls the image by its manifest digest and verifies it, then builds the served checkpoint with SparkQwen's own install/tandem_overlay.py, fetched at the pinned revision, digest-checked and run inside the image with no network.",
  "license": {
    "id": "MIT",
    "name": "Recipe metadata, launcher and orchestration"
  },
  "provenance": {
    "createdBy": "lloom",
    "generatedBy": "manual-curated",
    "source": "SparkQwen 0.7.0: Enntity/sparkqwen 30fa63c2b888d17daabcad822f961df6fb7afdf0 (tag v0.7.0, install tree 5b9fecbcf5d9f9318611db0f380338a3ccf37e9e), engine Enntity/atlas q27/conc @ 6a7091b3b54e52d797ec59429903c8c617974376 (the series merged upstream as Atlas-Inf/atlas#333, plus three prefix-cache fixes for long conversations, a shared-scan decode attention that about doubles decode speed at 200K tokens of context, a scheduler fix so a request that joins two or more decoding requests keeps its speculation, and a --stream-loop-guards flag; AGPL-3.0-only, recorded in the image's /opt/atlas/source-manifest.json). Image ghcr.io/enntity/atlas-sparkqwen:5b9fecbcf5d9-27b (also :0.7.0-27b), addressed by its GHCR manifest digest. All three profiles turn off the engine's content-loop watchdog and stream loop guards, which cut long structured and code answers short. Profiles ship in the image as /opt/atlas/profiles/27b.json (0.85 GPU memory utilization, 64 sequences), 27b-saver.json (0.59, 8) and 27b-max.json (0.84, 32, both drafters), all at 262144 tokens with BF16 KV. Model nvidia/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4 revision 482ca0f3832238542f8f5295dde86b5f22711d80; drafters incoai/Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2 @ 015e795645c74b1a0eeef3b570031fb62e769bc5 and tencent/Qwen3.8-27B-DSpine-b16 @ ea909c0f5fab8865f9e14600334f55f7ce47308f; overlay weights 0xBakeer/TandemLLM-Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4 @ ab09c92fa4a90d5cfd9d012fe92831c886efd9b2 (Apache-2.0, weights only)."
  },
